{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare for battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft tactics, mix gear, and unlock endless possibilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras/0697ebadc70800aa87e1d833e5ae5a84.avif?t=1759184767\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aid the vulnerable kingdom soldiers and uncover the source of the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras/8648588fa617c0374a12ca1bb563eb40.avif?t=1759184767\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging the Impossible</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the last bit of courage left</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras/0b5be0fb57c5a479b10bf2cf7180044b.avif?t=1759184767\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement</strong>: Use keyboard keys WASD or left mouse button.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack</strong>: Right mouse button.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory</strong>: Press B to open the inventory. Right-click on equipment to wear it. Right-click on an already equipped slot to remove the item.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discard Items</strong>: Drag items outside the window to discard them. Discarded items cannot be recovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills</strong>: After learning a skill, press J to open the skills interface. Click and drag skill icons into the skill bar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Using Skills</strong>: Press the corresponding number key on the keyboard to select a skill, then use the right mouse button to activate it. Press the same number key again to switch back to normal attacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Notes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a maximum level of 30, with five main chapters and one hidden ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment with the \u3010Mimic\u3011 tag can only be equipped once. It grants a stat boost multiplied by the player\u2019s current level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeat, selecting &quot;LAST RECORD&quot; allows you to retain items and status changes, while selecting &quot;BACK TO LOGIN&quot; logs you out and returns you to the last save point.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the main city, there is a &quot;Chamber of Teleportation&quot; that allows travel to villages where teleportation has been unlocked. To unlock teleportation to a village, speak with the NPC in that village.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to contact the author at: <a href=\"mailto:331818250@qq.com\">331818250@qq.com</a>. Let\u2019s work together to make the game even better!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Go to Fatinha","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917190/bbad4c51cb67797acfbc31e54d5662ef08700baa.jpg"},{"name":"Fatinha's Underground Labyrinth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917190/17a58a224d7d5897e3cab59844bd266d1cd46936.jpg"},{"name":"Missing persons","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917190/06d113c917af4545cca49da8d6a245f6d6df8c8c.jpg"},{"name":"Eric's Great Sword","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917190/4c8f5a1991e70565886690150fdfab02ae1d0e5c.jpg"},{"name":"Dark Doctor Alexis","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917190/33a637c187929344666e88d0ef662f6c8a8277de.jpg"},{"name":"BlackCrystal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917190/25a0575cdf3b0293d04f2221032e2e280efd7e88.jpg"},{"name":"Discover the magic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917190/204f178cfe60048652786bf89fa7f0c77635956a.jpg"},{"name":"Thief Buster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917190/8eab3fbc9a2252ba4670b1f1bda955b827bfedbc.jpg"},{"name":"Clearing obstacles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917190/f3c4a57fc37ed27839c94ac1dcd5babc282dffb2.jpg"},{"name":"Power Worshiper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917190/03ea7c6f3a9e975aba24b92f6af5a4519c0089c6.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3917190?t=1759184767","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/1a64b802d33012b0471ad9bfaccdc0624b3be92a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759184767","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/7e93edcf8303ef717fc08754cc63e1b9f3ac81da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759184767","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/7e93edcf8303ef717fc08754cc63e1b9f3ac81da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759184767","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare for battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft tactics, mix gear, and unlock endless possibilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras/0697ebadc70800aa87e1d833e5ae5a84.avif?t=1759184767\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aid the vulnerable kingdom soldiers and uncover the source of the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras/8648588fa617c0374a12ca1bb563eb40.avif?t=1759184767\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging the Impossible</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the last bit of courage left</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/extras/0b5be0fb57c5a479b10bf2cf7180044b.avif?t=1759184767\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement</strong>: Use keyboard keys WASD or left mouse button.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack</strong>: Right mouse button.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory</strong>: Press B to open the inventory. Right-click on equipment to wear it. Right-click on an already equipped slot to remove the item.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discard Items</strong>: Drag items outside the window to discard them. Discarded items cannot be recovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills</strong>: After learning a skill, press J to open the skills interface. Click and drag skill icons into the skill bar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Using Skills</strong>: Press the corresponding number key on the keyboard to select a skill, then use the right mouse button to activate it. Press the same number key again to switch back to normal attacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Notes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a maximum level of 30, with five main chapters and one hidden ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment with the \u3010Mimic\u3011 tag can only be equipped once. It grants a stat boost multiplied by the player\u2019s current level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeat, selecting &quot;LAST RECORD&quot; allows you to retain items and status changes, while selecting &quot;BACK TO LOGIN&quot; logs you out and returns you to the last save point.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the main city, there is a &quot;Chamber of Teleportation&quot; that allows travel to villages where teleportation has been unlocked. To unlock teleportation to a village, speak with the NPC in that village.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to contact the author at: <a href=\"mailto:331818250@qq.com\">331818250@qq.com</a>. Let\u2019s work together to make the game even better!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["Meteorite Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917190/8d3e6e931b536d5173dd64cd828700880dda3954/header.jpg?t=1759184767","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"The game content is produced by the working group, and unpacking and other infringements are prohibited","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_